  <item>
    <title>Pay attention! 是纽约地标张骏！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a9aa888e355604d4fb998c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a9aa888e355604d4fb998c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Mar 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘿朋友们！欢迎收听新一期的 Funtastalk ！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNkT7emJDolvDxr4VDaTp8qyu14.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这期我邀请到了纽约地标、自由男神——放假回国的张骏，如果你常听我的播客，或者关注脱口秀节目，你应该对他不陌生。他也是我的老朋友，去年取得的诸多成就也让我颇为嫉妒。我和他聊了聊去美国读研半年的经历、有意思的故事，还有一直想聊但从来没和他认真聊过的，他的运动习惯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a> 哥大之光的回国感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a> 张骏现在很擅长 7 的乘法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">00:13:40</a> 纽约各个区域的介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a> 张骏的租房经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">00:21:37</a> 脱口秀演员的素材要用在短视频、段子里还是播客上？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">00:30:38</a> 品牌怎么选择博主？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">00:32:44</a> 张骏主持活动出了小岔子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">00:38:11</a> 纽约生活的三个好习惯：运动、晒太阳、pay attention</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">00:45:10</a> 张骏游泳有多快？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">00:48:51</a> 滑雪的乐趣是在控制中获得平静</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7Pck0Zl2N8lZUMPHSUfXrxHIF1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3234">00:53:54</a> 我认真打了一年乒乓球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3733">01:02:13</a> 张骏毕业后的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的专场《算你厉害》也还在巡演当中！朋友们现场见！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5eBSnCuIKz-gfNem3EcOrLr5co.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq87L3FW77CCGuMbprOT9S-36tHB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>剪辑：李乾</span></p>]]></description>
