  <item>
    <title>我和小佳和陈鸣飞和韩寒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699c6ab5a22480add6d19dcc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699c6ab5a22480add6d19dcc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们新年好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期 Funtastalk 是去年夏天录制的，算是一期声音胶囊。我邀请了刚出版新书《蜉蝣直上》的新晋作家、大e人小佳，和文学系男大、大i人陈鸣飞一起来我家玩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>素材有快四个小时，记录了我们从去菜市场买菜，到回家做饭、吃饭，饭后聊天的全过程。很轻松，很慵懒。希望你能轻轻松松地开启春节后的工作，收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpcxEm5SlwmbpDcXp0iLIVtVh_br.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">00:03:05</a> 去菜市场买菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">00:08:09</a> 小佳在厨房做饭，陈鸣飞在客厅写段子，很有过日子的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">00:10:52</a> 和外婆打视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">00:14:15</a> 陈鸣飞生气是什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">00:16:50</a> 小佳的三份工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">00:31:17</a> 小佳出社会面对的第一个诱惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">00:37:35</a> 陈鸣飞不想做全职演员的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">00:44:21</a> 小佳作文从来没写完过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2847">00:47:27</a> 小佳高二写的诗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOM6xRbS3CBa99dFUyJ31D4TQqC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">00:53:00</a> 韩寒对我们的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3764">01:02:44</a> 陈鸣飞的阅读习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4326">01:12:06</a> 小佳的书里有脱口秀表达不了的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4578">01:16:18</a> 风云浙商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4892">01:21:32</a> 让文学纯粹一点</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：李乾、空格</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e02af6da891a9cd9a2f65c/lgrVObnmz7J5N7MDV09K4sFlJokl.m4a" length="83393907" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEihzO8HhoYgFdXqsub48qoRRYA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>王继续和李梓溪！？你怎么在这儿？！！（feat momo）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6974545c109824f9e14281bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6974545c109824f9e14281bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 05:23:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1><span>shownotes</span></h1><span></span><p><span>朋友们好久不见，欢迎收听2026年第一期Funtastalk。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期请到了我在《喜人奇妙夜》里非常喜欢的演员王继续和李梓溪，还有我的好朋友、资深喜剧编剧Momo。我和继续，和梓溪都是第一次见面，但完全没有生疏感，我们从认识彼此最早的时刻聊起，聊到这些年舞台上、节目里、创作中的故事。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMLVnc4aIZc9MIE5iZLotaS2Top.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhK1iTaX9SAXU-yhkklitzXoKke2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvl8VZ4oCZOdfl5tA6Z7bp0F_O7G.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>我也从喜剧从业者和普通观众的视角，问了很多我好奇的问题：喜人的录制是什么样子的？创排怎么创？录完节目景就不要了吗？什么是大底？还想现场共创搞个本子出来，结果感受到了特别具体的绝望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 豆豆和Momo几年前就看过李梓溪演的话剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 和王继续认识之后，李梓溪才发现《喜剧大会》里有他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 李梓溪怎么下定决心去录喜人的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 《忘不了》出了剧本之后通宵排练，第二天就录制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 王继续在初赛段特别抢手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 李梓溪累到没参与节目片头录制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">22:59</a> 《忘不了》没上过展演，把录制当作话剧首演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> 王继续开创了展演拿剧本读的先河</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 买不到音乐版权怎么办？自己人唱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 王继续演古装戏的帽子不能洗，会有发酵的豆制品的味儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 因为李梓溪什么都能演，反而让编剧更难下笔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">52:05</a> 李梓溪在澡堂被观众认出来请求合影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3588">59:48</a> Momo看节目会带着编剧的思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3837">01:03:57</a> 什么是大底？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4254">01:10:54</a> 王继续特别喜欢的包袱，展演零人笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4392">01:13:12</a> 《再见，噶尔波》的大底，是有意为之的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4629">01:17:09</a> 总决赛前每个化妆间都很奇怪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4839">01:20:39</a> 五分钟共创一个本子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5443">01:30:43</a> 给想做sketch的朋友们一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，小鹿的专场《我的中女时代》已经在b站「好笑那个小鹿」的充电频道上线了，全球巡演111场之后，小鹿用电影级的制作标准把这个专场完整地录了下来，还没看过的朋友，现在可以随时随地想看就看啦！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjdI1m4pTvzknU_2YBOIXiSnDNiT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《算你厉害》的巡演也在继续，年后的城市又更新了一些，剧场见朋友们！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgXoFnMIibsxwyVKXrTKBCO_iW3.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoE5tc9tyybd_4H-urYE4jHnVXIa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>剪辑：李乾、空格</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片：小溪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e02af6da891a9cd9a2f65c/lnjdyYYpyIYgJrpdHrI6vrLeO7oF.m4a" length="92504720" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu4TzLpsZmx48Hdeb--T67wrgpY2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
