  <item>
    <title>什么？！Gap Year？！！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fb62e959699d74dc5d4e8a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fb62e959699d74dc5d4e8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 07:21:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哟！好久不见朋友们！欢迎大家收听这一期的</span><strong><span>Funtastalk！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期找来脱口秀演员、播客</span><em><strong><span>坐在角落的人</span></strong></em><span>的主播 </span><strong><span>梁海源 </span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>脱口秀演员</span><strong><span>唐坤</span></strong><span>，来聊聊旅居。</span></p><span></span><p><span>唐坤是那种践行“做一休一”的人：工作一年，休息一年，我非常羡慕这样的状态，主要是我不太相信，一个东亚小孩可以过这么洒脱的生活，海源哥也是那种会突然消失一段时间的人，然后带着一大坨新鲜的生活素材来到开放麦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你最近很累，工作让你烦心，可以听听这期播客，人生就那么长，不如出门儿去玩玩，希望你收听愉快！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlP4drkuIbG5o-rjyxHxjJLFSMBy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a>“工作年”总是很痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a>唐坤凭什么有自信在“工作年”就找到工作呢？原来她是“世界第一”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a>梁海源的梦想是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>2个月搞定匈牙利语？不！匈牙利语这门语言应该消失？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a>我们怎么看待 鲜花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a>外婆和桂花树的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4168">69:28</a>爱好其实可以很简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4658">77:38</a>梁海源想去南半球割花椰菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5594">93:14</a>建议，随便听听</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqle39Ta4wxFT5X6_gahgljJUxmK.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>小红书官方杂志书「about关于」与小宇宙共同发起「给明天的一句话」毕业季特别企划，希望通过自我养育、亲密关系、技术焦虑、重建意义等议题的探讨，和大家一起思考「我们如何面对不确定的明天？」欢迎在小红书和小宇宙搜索「给明天的一句话」，进入活动页了解更多。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：空格、何空、豆豆</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《鲜花》-回春丹</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e02af6da891a9cd9a2f65c/liLi0BShXD5t8I6sjQMla3PZg7y4.m4a" length="156498453" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:47:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgySng02GsSfpyquDOz5wdlyZui9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>2024，You Good？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ac13d42faa72d7a8ff6c46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ac13d42faa72d7a8ff6c46</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 03:30:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见朋友们，欢迎大家收听这一期的Funtastalk！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期是在苏州演完出之后，拽着好朋友张骏和大狗来房间录的，回顾了一下我们的2024，一些高光时刻，一些失意的瞬间，去年我们三个人的境遇不完全相同，但彼此之间又有很深的交集，除了喜剧这个我们从事的行业以外，我们的生活也被各种小事儿串联起来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv7UHL_53eiAhFe_1fBY8R5KSgBd.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGNYs62NTvMUSooKyVpERrzdDly.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuixDJ5n4B45xh3Tq4CTDFlZZHJA.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a></span></strong><span> 你的2024打几分？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a></span></strong><span> 时间是有密度的，张骏这一年的密度很大</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a></span></strong><span> 大狗的2024刚刚及格</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a></span></strong><span>那一天我夜不能寐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a></span></strong><span>硬汉韩大狗深夜嚎啕大哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> yo Stephe，you good？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a>Kanye West，海口你好吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a>掌握的新技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a>千金难买我开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a>年纪上来了，开始拉伸了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a>解锁的新地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3393">56:33</a>交到的新朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">60:02</a>新的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4570">76:10</a>我们的年度歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片：LIUZY</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：豆豆、空格</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核：毛衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Sweet Connection》-Fredi/Dabeull</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新鸳鸯蝴蝶梦》-黄安</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e02af6da891a9cd9a2f65c/lp_GMHGyRJyF5izFOWArWhz7aoBk.m4a" length="112937865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:49</itunes:duration>
