  <item>
    <title>人类才会讨论生死，大海其实毫不在乎</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674711f311045e78e56b7984</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674711f311045e78e56b7984</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 朋友们，又见面了</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听这一期的</span><strong><span>Funtastalk</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一次很特别的节目，是我去</span><strong><span>小佳</span></strong><span>家里蹭饭的声音记录，voice log。</span></p><span></span><p><span>认识了两位新的朋友，都是来疯的演员，话比较多的是</span><strong><span>大鸟</span></strong><span>，她是一个舞台剧演员，比较腼腆的是脱口秀演员</span><strong><span>阿腌</span></strong><span>，不得不说小佳是一个很厉害的攒局人，大家完全没有感到不舒服、局促，很快热络起来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小佳新租的房子就在海边，吃完饭我们就去楼下买了一些啤酒薯片，坐在海边聊天，我没有去预设任何的主题，我想让聊天自然发生，我原本还担心麦克风会束缚大家的表达，没有，我们聊到了我原来从来没有想过去触碰的一个命题，死亡，但好在四个人构建的聊天场域足够安全，大家也都很开心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>潮水慢慢过来，我们就各自离去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>它很符合我做这个播客的初衷，祝大家收听愉快，stay warm。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a>roomtour</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>小佳话剧趣事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-Bk3-A7kLTJKY7MMzxhg_sroPo.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a>合唱张震岳《再见》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a>围聚海边</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn7Y6rqWW-2dEer1ipgEdBxMpNVw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a>外婆声如洪钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>那棵树</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSiXsrYglptqau8ctlvY_cfrJMo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">30:13</a>大鸟的狗今天去汪星</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtksUObelNmoMYqkPdPegB-3Z-wa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2241">37:21</a>女朋友家的狗：Luyi，蝴蝶犬，脸真的很像一只大蝴蝶</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneNTBosV4ND7eWvsA1vMGxe5Gcv.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a>小佳外婆的固执的坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a>对自己葬礼的奇妙幻想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a>时不时刷新的NPC捡瓶子婆婆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a>周边大讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a>有点冒犯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4009">66:49</a>小佳上价值的王</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Funge54fgxT-wQeWjUyZZt7L1ND5.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片：LIUZY</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：豆豆、空格</span></p><span></span><p><span>审核：毛衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Drifting》-NECHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>《存在》-汪峰</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgBVqPMZx22YC4eQ60EN9CQDENml.m4a" length="105198341" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSwBCLdXx06Ffb1guAMGKxVaDns.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>小鱼：高考奖金让我变身县城婆罗门（feat大国手）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67249f5733c798676faebf2c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67249f5733c798676faebf2c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Nov 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，朋友们，欢迎大家收听这一期的</span><strong><span>Funtastalk</span></strong><span>！</span></p><p><span>录完节目歇了一段时间，人就是要休息的。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpi92XK28LupqCm9KdtJiS5gnBXv.JPG"></figure><p><span>这次温州的喜剧节，找到了小鱼聊聊，刚好大国手也在，还没有圆梦头盔，那就再来一期。小鱼和大国手虽然都是我交的新朋友，但很快就熟络起来，熟人局。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a>哈拉寒暄</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a>最近的近况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a>回归北大的小鱼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a>大国手被热情观众送上法式香吻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a>小鱼的父亲老泪纵横</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a>中国孩子的传统报喜不报忧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a>逆天改命余东侠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a>所有喜剧演员的痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a>苏姐金句：人拥有对自己的第一解释权</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a>你为什么呢？？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3099">51:39</a>段子删减很心痛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">60:05</a>试图收尾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4404">73:24</a>再次收尾</span></p><p><span>图片：LIUZY</span></p><p><span>后期：豆豆、空格</span></p><p><span>审核：毛衣</span></p><p><span>BGM：《夜空中最亮的星》——逃跑计划</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lieYFNJhr5aVre6CJxfE45Ck9ZN9.m4a" length="114187745" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmrdbgvvKu-HE1P_BD3Lr3X1htaw.png"/>
